  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Support for the Centre for Action on Access to Climate Finance</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">To establish an independent centre (&quot;The Centre&quot;) of research, analysis and expertise to disseminate the evidence from the Pioneer Country trials and gather, share and apply lessons learned between climate vulnerable countries to help develop new solutions, scale-up successes and advance global discourse. The Centre will also serve as an independent Secretariat to the Taskforce on Access to Climate Finance. The Centre will respond to an unmet need for a global hub of information, analysis and idea generation on climate and nature finance access, as identified through market soundings.</narrative>
  </description>
